[style name="VisualNovelDialogueStyle"]
GRANNY: This is tutorial house
[i]You walk up to the quaint but run down house and slowly make your way to the door[/i]
*Ding Dong*
[i]The door slowly opens and you see a small grey snout peeking out[/i]

MC: “Trick or treat?...”

[i]The door flies open and you see a very strange sight[/i]
[i]What looks like a wolf dressed in…[/i]
[i]A pink nightgown?[/i]

join graham (default) center

graham: “Hello and good evening!”
graham: “Welcome to my very humble abode!”

join graham (happy) center

[i]You look up and down the house[/i]
[i]It doesn’t look very humble to you[/i]
[i]You look back at graham Wolf[/i]

MC: “I… like your costume?...”

join graham (default) center

graham: “Costume?”
graham: “Oh you mean this silly thing”

[i]He points to the nightgown[/i]

join graham (happy) center

graham: “No no this is just my nightly dress now, I’m getting a little old you see”

MC: “Um.. okay?...”
MC: “Do you have any candy?”

[i]The graham Wolf wags his finger at you in protest[/i]

join graham (default) center

graham: “No no no little one that’s not how you do that”
graham: “Let me explain”


graham: “On this street you have to convince each household to give you candy”
graham: “You see the top right of your screen?”
graham: “That shows how convinced we are that you deserve candy”
graham: “The more this bar fills up, the more candy we will give you”
graham: “Isn’t that nice!”

MC: (That is pretty nice)

graham: “Now you’re probably wondering how to fill up that bar now huh”
graham: “Don’t get ahead of yourself little one”
graham: “To convince us on (Figure out street name) you’ll have to choose what you think will please us most!”
graham: “Every one of us is swayed by something different, so be sure to do your research before you jump in”
graham: “There are 4 different means of persuasion; Intimidation, Friendliness, Knowledge, and Comedy”

[i]You hear a meow come from inside the house[/i]

graham: “Oh I forgot about this little guy”
graham: “Here, you take care of him for now”

[i]He hands you a small tuxedo cat, you feel a sense of peace wash over you[/i]

graham: “He seems to like you, he never purrs that way with me”
graham: “Now back to the subject”
graham: “I want you to try and convince me to give you some candy”

#ROUND START
graham: “Don’t worry about choosing the wrong answer, you’ve already convinced me you deserve some”

